  "structural_identity": {
    "N_star": "N_star = d + 2*m + 1 = 3*m + k + 1",
    "exact_identity": true,
    "formula": "Res_{m,d}(y) = - L(b^{(k+1)})(y),  k = d - m",
    "proof_sketch": [
      "Based a_odd=0 \u21d2 only E- jet is a_m (pure powers).",
      "Mixed (E+,E-,E-) triples at order N_star require E+ order N_star - 2m = d+1 > d, unavailable as a polynomial jet.",
      "Hence Res at N_star is pure triple-E+ Phi_+ of jets b^{(s)}, s odd, m+s <= d i.e. s <= k.",
      "Those triples are exactly R_pre at formal stage r = k+1.",
      "The recurrence defines b^{(k+1)} by L(b^{(k+1)}) = -R_pre.",
      "Therefore Res = -L(b^{(k+1)})."
    ]
  },
